      "solution": "As $x\\to0$, $1-\\cos x\\sim x^2/2$. Writing $u=1-\\cos x$, we also have $1-\\cos u\\sim u^2/2\\sim x^4/8$. Dividing by $x^4$ gives the limit $1/8$.",
